    "# Multi-Step Reasoning & Prompt Chaining — Rebuilt & Evaluated\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this notebook does:** compares a 3-stage LLM prompt chain\n",
    "(decompose → solve → synthesize) against a single-shot baseline on\n",
    "multi-step quantitative reasoning problems, scored with **exact-match\n",
    "numeric accuracy** and ROUGE.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "
   ]
  },
  {
