    "## 3. Evaluation set\n",
    "\n",
    "Four problems, all with the same answer shape so one grader handles all of them:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Q1** → one number\n",
    "- **Q2** → a label + a number\n",
    "- **Q3** → a label + a number\n",
    "\n",
    "Every ground-truth value below was computed by hand. Verify each one yourself\n",
    "before you rely on this — if the ground truth is wrong, every metric is wrong.\n",
    "\n",
    "Note problem 2's Q3: the answer *flips* after the cost cut (GenAI goes from\n",
    "more expensive per student to cheaper). That is deliberate — it catches models\n",
    "that pattern-match the earlier answer instead of recomputing."
   ]
  },
